  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cut lime into wedges Roughly chop cucumber, then place in a bowl. Add a good squeeze of lime juice. Drizzle with olive oil, then season and toss Thinly slice capsicum",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a3ef36aeb6abe99e11451d-6872ade8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a frying pan over high heat with a drizzle of olive oil Drain corn (1/2 large tin for 2P / 1 large tin for 4P) and chickpeas Cook chickpeas, corn and capsicum until browned, 2-3 mins Add spice blend, stock powder, tomato paste and a good dash of water. Cook, tossing, until browned, 1-2 mins. Season to taste, then remove from heat",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a3ef36aeb6abe99e11451d-0ddb61ad.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat basmati rice in microwave until steaming, 2-3 mins Add rice to chickpea pan, tossing to coat Plate up Tex-Mex chickpeas and rice. Top with cucumber salsa Drizzle with smokey aioli, tear over coriander and crumble over fetta Serve with remaining lime",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a3ef36aeb6abe99e11451d-dd5970e2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
